      "cooked": "<p>My apologies if this has already been posted/discussed one or more times, but my searches didn't turn anything up.</p><p>I have a Windows Phone and a 1st-generation Microsoft Surface (RT).<br>Are there any plans at this time to make an SotM app for the Windows Store?<br>If not - would someone please consider adding it to the 'to do' list?</p><p>Lots of great gaming companies making digital versions of some really great games - but this is being done almost exclusively for iOS or iOS/Android.<br>I just want some love for my mobile platform of choice :)</p>",
